# SecGuardian License

SecGuardian is dual-licensed:

## 1. Source Code (Apache 2.0)

The SecGuardian source code — including the Go indexer, Python scripts,
shell scripts, and configuration files — is licensed under Apache 2.0.

See LICENSE-CODE.txt for the full license text.

## 2. Knowledge Base (CC BY-NC 4.0)

The SecGuardian knowledge base — including detector rules, audit rules,
review guidelines, and skill definitions — is licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International.

See LICENSE-KNOWLEDGE.txt for the full license text.

